# =============================================================================
# Environment Variables — Framework Template
# =============================================================================
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values:
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# .env is gitignored — your values stay local.
# =============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Push Notifications (ntfy.sh)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Get notified on your phone/desktop when long-running tasks complete.
#
# Setup:
#   1. Install the ntfy app on your phone (iOS/Android) or use the web UI
#   2. Pick a unique topic slug (treat it like a password — anyone with it can send)
#   3. Subscribe to the topic in the app
#   4. Set NTFY_TOPIC below
#
# Test it:
#   python scripts/notify.py "Hello from the framework!"
#
NTFY_TOPIC=
# NTFY_SERVER=https://ntfy.sh          # Optional: custom self-hosted server
# NTFY_TOKEN=                           # Optional: bearer token for authenticated servers
